{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/litologia/sapropel",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "sapropel",
    "es": "sapropel"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Jelly like organic rich sediment composed of plant remains, usually algal. liptinite to inertinite ratio is greater than one (economic commission for europe, committee on sustainable energy- united nations (ece-un), 1998, international classification of in-seam coals: energy 19, 41 pp.).",
    "es": "Sedimento gelatinoso rico en materia orgánica formado por restos de plantas, habitualmente algas. la relación entre liptinita e inertinita es mayor de 1 (comisión económica para europa, comité de la energía sostenible - naciones unidas (ece-un), 1998, international classification of in-seam coals: energy 19, 41 pp.)."
  },
  "broader": {
    "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/litologia/sedimento-rico-en-materia-organica",
